sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant Net as Network
    participant S as Server
    
    Note over C, S: HTTP/2 over TCP (HoL Blocking)
    C->>Net: Send TCP Pkt 1 (Stream A)
    C->>Net: Send TCP Pkt 2 (Stream B)
    C->>Net: Send TCP Pkt 3 (Stream A) [DROPPED]
    C->>Net: Send TCP Pkt 4 (Stream B)
    
    Net->>S: Deliver Pkt 1 (Stream A)
    Net->>S: Deliver Pkt 2 (Stream B)
    Note over S: Pkt 3 Missing! TCP buffers Pkt 4
    Net--xS: Pkt 3 Dropped
    Net->>S: Deliver Pkt 4 (Stream B)
    Note over S: Stream B is BLOCKED waiting for Pkt 3 retransmission
    
    C->>Net: Retransmit Pkt 3
    Net->>S: Deliver Pkt 3
    Note over S: Pkt 3 & 4 processed together
    
    
    Note over C, S: HTTP/3 over QUIC (Independent Streams)
    C->>Net: Send UDP Pkt 1 (Stream A)
    C->>Net: Send UDP Pkt 2 (Stream B)
    C->>Net: Send UDP Pkt 3 (Stream A) [DROPPED]
    C->>Net: Send UDP Pkt 4 (Stream B)
    
    Net->>S: Deliver Pkt 1 (Stream A)
    Net->>S: Deliver Pkt 2 (Stream B)
    Net--xS: Pkt 3 Dropped
    Net->>S: Deliver Pkt 4 (Stream B)
    Note over S: Stream B processes Pkt 4 immediately! Zero HoL.
    Note over S: Stream A waits for Pkt 3 retransmission
    
    C->>Net: Retransmit Pkt 3
    Net->>S: Deliver Pkt 3
